{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "207306e75f8dca3a47c62303a9d4a389b53880d9e7257bcdf030463ba45e5536", "ja": "（今日は育の宣材写真の撮影日だ。緊張してないか\n心配だな。……ちょっと様子を見に行ってみるか）", "zh": "（今天是帮育拍摄宣传照的日子。\n真担心她会不会紧张……去看看她的状况吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_002_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "66ec9c9056039d80b5c222e166083d7ee21c2d0433cddd035b4b983943d416a6", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さんだ！\nおはようございます！", "zh": "啊，是{$P$}先生！\n早安！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_002_1002_p", "source_sha256": "dc0c2f159992ece67b2e616376bfba25ccac2266d8b63af339e926e9e9a56bff", "ja": "おはよう育！\n今日も元気だね。", "zh": "早啊，育！\n你今天也很有活力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_002_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "aa5f8b636fc839dacd3dd8fcc48862b96657d52287080c482b1a71232abee95d", "ja": "うん！\n早起きして、いっぱいご飯食べたんだ。", "zh": "嗯！\n我很早就起床，吃得很饱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_002_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "73dca9997610baf1ffbf062e4af96cf1246070712a4568b0881c950128de8dfa", "ja": "目覚ましより早く起きたんだよ？\nえへへ、すごいでしょ！", "zh": "我在闹钟响之前就起床啰！\n嘿嘿，很厉害吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_002_1005_p", "source_sha256": "61c0ea7c25fb2a2226168c18d450de88d87169e196ad9c8c0020583d07d7bbe9", "ja": "ああ、すごいな。\n今日は宣材写真を撮るけど、緊張してないか？", "zh": "嗯，真厉害。\n今天要拍宣传照，你不会紧张吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_002_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "e414f546531001c0b75c19e33c308b05f09601edf0fb7bd3e4ed0ee7096dc659", "ja": "ぜんぜん！　わたし、せんざいしゃしんの撮影、\nすごく楽しみで、昨日の夜から……。", "zh": "完全不会！我很期待拍宣传照，\n从昨天晚上就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_002_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "be5b42f0d430b8de81cc9c191344227eca23049b6d146157280266abb830a8f7", "ja": "……ふ……ふわぁ～。", "zh": "……呼……呼哇～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_002_1008_p", "source_sha256": "faea1daa7288c09f1f9a728e1382ee98a6fc40f8db30f39f059be04d70032b8c", "ja": "育？\n大丈夫か？", "zh": "育？\n你还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_002_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "fbcaa1474f68d6e5ba8c876212656f687f2ca245957a7c999acc83f9f8cc51ab", "ja": "だ、だいじょうぶだよ！\nぜんぜん眠くないもんっ！", "zh": "没、没问题喔！\n我完全不想睡觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_002_1010_p", "source_sha256": "459c99a077e2e5f29e9517cec3e1e7acf001f764f22978c850d41bbb2616c35b", "ja": "そうか。\nそれじゃあ、先にメイクを済ませてこようか。", "zh": "是吗。\n那就先去化妆吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_002_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "14b6b07da1b1b50defdf0015548a091e634c335a3c1c2359a5c0e3e2daab3a18", "ja": "ふぁ……あ、はーい！", "zh": "呼哇……好、好的──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_002_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3420535b44d96cf243763dd6d0568df4afbaa74f3c89025c3414ed799af64966", "ja": "（緊張はしてないみたいだけど、早起きしたから\n今になって眠くなってきたみたいだな……）", "zh": "（虽然她似乎不紧张，但因为太早起，\n好像开始想睡了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_002_1013_p", "source_sha256": "721a1f63ee1565576b07c99d204776dbed21c4b9ce54cdb90bad4b18efdec898", "ja": "（撮影中に居眠りはしないだろうけど、\n一応、気をつけて見守ろう）", "zh": "（我想她应该不会在拍摄时打瞌睡，\n但我还是在旁边注意一下吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_002_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "7012aaddef78dd92cf881816060f0e3148bbe5c63e305bca3c834d77b3e07ba9", "ja": "メイクさんに、いっぱいパタパタされちゃった！\nえへへ、くすぐったかった～！", "zh": "化妆师在我脸上拍了很多东西！\n嘿嘿，好痒～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_002_1015_p", "source_sha256": "fca32b0d010ebd3f6c6cdd26dd4288843404baf6d90c4de2ef0b2db35f66d548", "ja": "はは、撮影用のメイクは、普段とは違うからね。", "zh": "哈哈，因为拍照用的妆跟平时不一样嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_002_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "0bbc00b029e376a93670c87e3d00b720df6f7bcdc3f5850889a6e050678c86b3", "ja": "うん、劇団でしてもらってたメイクとも、\nぜんぜん違ったよ！", "zh": "嗯，跟我在剧团时帮我化的妆也完全不一样喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_002_1017_030iku", "source_sha256": "b5fdda34df48be7499993509ec0b352cfcfcb77ded1c362501ff67b34d8fbb65", "ja": "これでわたしも、おとなのアイドルの仲間入りだね！\nえへへ♪", "zh": "这样一来我也成为一名大人偶像了！\n嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_002_1018_p", "source_sha256": "97c8f021f991fedb41b2035b2a5ebffceb8686aa58599cc2614213161514405e", "ja": "大人とはちょっと違うけど、大人っぽくはなったよ。\n撮影、頑張れそうか？", "zh": "虽然算不上大人，但的确变成熟了。\n你能打起精神努力拍照吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_002_1019_030iku", "source_sha256": "3d04d1980294c03ef7a0cb555ecdece3d5e37a9163bb29527181c6e72cfb508a", "ja": "うん、だいじょうぶ！\n{$P$}さん、わたしにまかせて！", "zh": "嗯，别担心！\n{$P$}先生，交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_030iku_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_002_1020_p", "source_sha256": "37168b0674aed76b7de8ed9e7b513bade2471bb50690b4998b2bf6741f9ec5d2", "ja": "（メイクに感動して、眠気も吹き飛んだみたいだな。\n元気はじける、いい写真が撮れそうだ！）", "zh": "（因为对妆容很感动，她的睡意好像都散了。\n看来应该能拍出充满活力的好照片！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
